{
  "bvid": "BV1bM4m117Yd",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "bbdb1b588656537c9aa09b62a1945a461110dfd80c051127eb45352ec3626ef0",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 180,
      "end_ms": 2820,
      "text": "而且这些人肯定是会分裂的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 2820,
      "end_ms": 5340,
      "text": "他们就是归根结理念是不不同的嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 5340,
      "end_ms": 7880,
      "text": "有的是在劳动过程中受欺负了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 7880,
      "end_ms": 8700,
      "text": "极进化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 10360,
      "end_ms": 11240,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 11240,
      "end_ms": 13800,
      "text": "有的是是怀念他以前那个日子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 13800,
      "end_ms": 15200,
      "text": "那个以后以前禁欲主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 15200,
      "end_ms": 18080,
      "text": "保守的那个等级制的那个日子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 18080,
      "end_ms": 19410,
      "text": "那这也是极有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 19410,
      "end_ms": 21910,
      "text": "然后有的是这个中右翼这些小商人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 21910,
      "end_ms": 24260,
      "text": "小摊贩或者小小妇人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 24260,
      "end_ms": 27700,
      "text": "他拿来这个给自己这个赎罪券"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 27700,
      "end_ms": 29180,
      "text": "心里心安理得一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 29180,
      "end_ms": 29680,
      "text": "赚到钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 29680,
      "end_ms": 30580,
      "text": "心安理得享受"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 30580,
      "end_ms": 31790,
      "text": "心安理得一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 31790,
      "end_ms": 33570,
      "text": "那有的是中左翼的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 33570,
      "end_ms": 36190,
      "text": "他想要以这种这种温和的方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 36190,
      "end_ms": 39870,
      "text": "这种旅游的方式才能实现它的那个秘密串联"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 39870,
      "end_ms": 43130,
      "text": "他不想直接的就去嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 43130,
      "end_ms": 45290,
      "text": "然后这个钟左翼的秘密串联了之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 45290,
      "end_ms": 48810,
      "text": "他又和西方什么自由势力啊啊策应啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 48810,
      "end_ms": 49990,
      "text": "策应一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 49990,
      "end_ms": 51390,
      "text": "说乱起来上街了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 51390,
      "end_ms": 53030,
      "text": "他策应一下啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 53030,
      "end_ms": 54620,
      "text": "他自己可能不上街"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 54620,
      "end_ms": 56020,
      "text": "就这就这些东西嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 56020,
      "end_ms": 59570,
      "text": "他可能我说这四个四派人全在里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 59570,
      "end_ms": 61430,
      "text": "然后这是一个共享的旗号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 61430,
      "end_ms": 63210,
      "text": "这个旗号反正就不会直接给你打掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 63210,
      "end_ms": 64650,
      "text": "因为这打掉太难看了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 64650,
      "end_ms": 68230,
      "text": "那不是这个否认了这个建国的价值的基础嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 68230,
      "end_ms": 70100,
      "text": "核心嘛是吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 70580,
      "end_ms": 71360,
      "text": "懂了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 71360,
      "end_ms": 73220,
      "text": "就各怀鬼胎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 73220,
      "end_ms": 74620,
      "text": "这里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 77320,
      "end_ms": 79920,
      "text": "然后这这当中有一些是共同点吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 79920,
      "end_ms": 82130,
      "text": "比如说找最穷的人去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 82130,
      "end_ms": 87240,
      "text": "就是直接的去所谓实践去帮帮到这些最穷的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 87240,
      "end_ms": 89120,
      "text": "那么这四四类人的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 89120,
      "end_ms": 92380,
      "text": "我看这四类人当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 100790,
      "end_ms": 103510,
      "text": "因为他这个觉得自己更高尚了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 103510,
      "end_ms": 104870,
      "text": "更完美的更高尚了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 104870,
      "end_ms": 106800,
      "text": "第二类中左也愿意的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 106800,
      "end_ms": 110080,
      "text": "因为过程当中可以和不同的势力力量打交道嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 110080,
      "end_ms": 111240,
      "text": "就掩盖他的串联"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 111240,
      "end_ms": 113120,
      "text": "掩盖他的现金流或者啥的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 113120,
      "end_ms": 115000,
      "text": "掩盖他人的踪迹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 115000,
      "end_ms": 116820,
      "text": "那就是有正当民意的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 116820,
      "end_ms": 118280,
      "text": "那么第三类中右翼呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 118280,
      "end_ms": 119200,
      "text": "他是赎罪券吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 119200,
      "end_ms": 120840,
      "text": "赎罪券就跟放生一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 120840,
      "end_ms": 122780,
      "text": "就是和捐香火钱一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 122780,
      "end_ms": 124470,
      "text": "然后第四类呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 124470,
      "end_ms": 127610,
      "text": "极右翼的极右翼的是正好被帮到的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 127610,
      "end_ms": 128160,
      "text": "就是他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 128160,
      "end_ms": 128840,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 128840,
      "end_ms": 130759,
      "text": "就怀念以前的是等级制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 130759,
      "end_ms": 133840,
      "text": "怀念以前他在那种什么封闭保守的时代当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 133840,
      "end_ms": 134780,
      "text": "他获利状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 134780,
      "end_ms": 136990,
      "text": "他想回到就不要市场经济"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 136990,
      "end_ms": 139480,
      "text": "他回到那个极度保守的那个状态了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 139480,
      "end_ms": 140120,
      "text": "对吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 140120,
      "end_ms": 141360,
      "text": "你政府缺位也不帮我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 141360,
      "end_ms": 142760,
      "text": "我现在穷的要死"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 142760,
      "end_ms": 143560,
      "text": "你只要帮我就行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 143560,
      "end_ms": 144000,
      "text": "极有意思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 144000,
      "end_ms": 145000,
      "text": "就我直接占便宜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 145000,
      "end_ms": 146940,
      "text": "他们对我就有好处"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 146940,
      "end_ms": 149910,
      "text": "这四代人嗯对啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 149910,
      "end_ms": 151310,
      "text": "这不是内循环起来了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 151310,
      "end_ms": 153290,
      "text": "玩的妈的四种意识形态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 155850,
      "end_ms": 157670,
      "text": "不都混到一块去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 157670,
      "end_ms": 162810,
      "text": "嗯然后这个中右翼是实际上是轻建制的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 162810,
      "end_ms": 166410,
      "text": "中左翼呢其实是也是轻贱值"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 166410,
      "end_ms": 167810,
      "text": "也是比较轻贱值的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 167810,
      "end_ms": 169610,
      "text": "然后他的两个极派的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 169610,
      "end_ms": 172490,
      "text": "他就是比较呃比较反反反抗的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 172490,
      "end_ms": 174330,
      "text": "比较反对的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 177960,
      "end_ms": 180680,
      "text": "但是就是他和反对方式不一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 180680,
      "end_ms": 181940,
      "text": "反对方式不一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 181940,
      "end_ms": 184440,
      "text": "唉有点差别"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 184930,
      "end_ms": 186210,
      "text": "有那么点差别"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 186210,
      "end_ms": 187050,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 187050,
      "end_ms": 188610,
      "text": "一个是想要乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 190750,
      "end_ms": 194350,
      "text": "极右翼是想要就是复辟啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 194350,
      "end_ms": 197210,
      "text": "想要那种封闭保守的复辟等级是复辟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 201540,
      "end_ms": 203380,
      "text": "然后所有人都啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 203380,
      "end_ms": 205880,
      "text": "然后农村乡村二元制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 205880,
      "end_ms": 208840,
      "text": "然后是什么农村里面的什么大队啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 208840,
      "end_ms": 210800,
      "text": "什么这些东西都回来啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 210800,
      "end_ms": 214110,
      "text": "过过上那种庄园里面等级制的生活"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 215110,
      "end_ms": 216230,
      "text": "唉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 218720,
      "end_ms": 222540,
      "text": "丝绒然四种人的话都会扛着个旗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 222540,
      "end_ms": 225140,
      "text": "都会扛着原教旨嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 225140,
      "end_ms": 229850,
      "text": "打着以前开国领袖的这个旗号嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 229850,
      "end_ms": 235250,
      "text": "然后他自己这个他本人呢其实是一个呃中左翼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 236330,
      "end_ms": 241210,
      "text": "其实是一个呃中左翼嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 241730,
      "end_ms": 244910,
      "text": "中间偏左一点就是比较投机性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 244910,
      "end_ms": 246170,
      "text": "比较狡猾的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 246170,
      "end_ms": 247410,
      "text": "你知"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 249960,
      "end_ms": 252800,
      "text": "这个左指的是指的是开放"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 252800,
      "end_ms": 256579,
      "text": "我们这里左右就是开放和保守"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 256579,
      "end_ms": 259589,
      "text": "就是说西方意识上的左右啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 259589,
      "end_ms": 261449,
      "text": "因为这些人在我们看来都是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 261449,
      "end_ms": 264740,
      "text": "用这个西方话语里面民粹主义来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 264740,
      "end_ms": 265920,
      "text": "民粹主义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 265920,
      "end_ms": 267100,
      "text": "就是统统打引号的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 267100,
      "end_ms": 268300,
      "text": "就是民粹主义左右"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 268300,
      "end_ms": 271130,
      "text": "他是就这四类都是民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 271130,
      "end_ms": 273130,
      "text": "那么这是比较左的民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 273130,
      "end_ms": 274770,
      "text": "和比较右的民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 274770,
      "end_ms": 275510,
      "text": "明白吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 275510,
      "end_ms": 280570,
      "text": "其实说这个他本人其实是是是比较左的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 280570,
      "end_ms": 282240,
      "text": "民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 282440,
      "end_ms": 284720,
      "text": "买比较左的民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 287940,
      "end_ms": 290100,
      "text": "钟左翼的民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 293600,
      "end_ms": 297390,
      "text": "这个这个就是中国人民粹主义是这样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 297390,
      "end_ms": 300270,
      "text": "你不能评价中左翼和中右翼的民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 300270,
      "end_ms": 302550,
      "text": "这都他们民粹主义都都需要做好事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 302550,
      "end_ms": 302830,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 302830,
      "end_ms": 303750,
      "text": "都会干好事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 303750,
      "end_ms": 308009,
      "text": "就是给自己上道德上价值就是叠盾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 308009,
      "end_ms": 310149,
      "text": "那么中左翼的民粹主义呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 310149,
      "end_ms": 311389,
      "text": "他这个干好事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 311389,
      "end_ms": 314370,
      "text": "他他的意思就是说你政府应当干"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 314370,
      "end_ms": 315110,
      "text": "而你没干"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 315110,
      "end_ms": 316210,
      "text": "我干了之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 316210,
      "end_ms": 317990,
      "text": "我就比你政府更像政府"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 317990,
      "end_ms": 319650,
      "text": "是中左翼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 320250,
      "end_ms": 321270,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 321270,
      "end_ms": 322210,
      "text": "中左翼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 323650,
      "end_ms": 324730,
      "text": "然后中右翼的呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 324730,
      "end_ms": 331180,
      "text": "他是会觉得是是这个你你政府不干"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 331180,
      "end_ms": 335960,
      "text": "就应当更有这个土生赌场的社会力量来干"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 335960,
      "end_ms": 337680,
      "text": "也不是商业来干啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 337680,
      "end_ms": 339140,
      "text": "不一定是这个市场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 339140,
      "end_ms": 340360,
      "text": "也某种意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 340360,
      "end_ms": 342420,
      "text": "他这里就因为他是好事嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 342420,
      "end_ms": 343840,
      "text": "肯定不是资本逻辑不行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 343840,
      "end_ms": 344690,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 344690,
      "end_ms": 346170,
      "text": "民粹主义是资本逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 346170,
      "end_ms": 348000,
      "text": "中右翼资本逻辑不行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 348000,
      "end_ms": 350320,
      "text": "民粹主义我讲的是民粹主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 350320,
      "end_ms": 352600,
      "text": "这民粹主义是反市场的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 352600,
      "end_ms": 356450,
      "text": "带有这么一个就是穷啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 356450,
      "end_ms": 357690,
      "text": "对对对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 357690,
      "end_ms": 360650,
      "text": "那个资本模式赚了钱的人看着不爽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 360650,
      "end_ms": 361470,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 361470,
      "end_ms": 364030,
      "text": "他就是会觉得你政府干不了这个事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 364030,
      "end_ms": 365630,
      "text": "但是呢我做中右翼的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 365630,
      "end_ms": 368700,
      "text": "我觉得就是应该社会当中好人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 368700,
      "end_ms": 373010,
      "text": "社会当中的这个就是中国"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 373010,
      "end_ms": 377090,
      "text": "一是觉得是你政府最好能够越来越能够去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 377090,
      "end_ms": 379760,
      "text": "你自己或者行政力量嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 379760,
      "end_ms": 381860,
      "text": "你自己来把这个事解决好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 381860,
      "end_ms": 384420,
      "text": "中优异的是觉得你政府就不要管这个事了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 384420,
      "end_ms": 386050,
      "text": "跟你没关系的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 386050,
      "end_ms": 391420,
      "text": "得是这个社会自己的这个呃那种土生土长的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 391420,
      "end_ms": 392500,
      "text": "其实前现代的关系了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 392500,
      "end_ms": 393060,
      "text": "前线的关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 393060,
      "end_ms": 394300,
      "text": "家族关系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 394300,
      "end_ms": 397140,
      "text": "还有乡里情啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 397140,
      "end_ms": 398320,
      "text": "是宗教关系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 398320,
      "end_ms": 399120,
      "text": "来解释这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 399120,
      "end_ms": 400060,
      "text": "那么极右翼呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 400060,
      "end_ms": 400920,
      "text": "极右翼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 400920,
      "end_ms": 403790,
      "text": "其实极右翼其实是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 403790,
      "end_ms": 408050,
      "text": "他不是说希望由政府来行政力量来干涉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 408050,
      "end_ms": 413100,
      "text": "来设置一个一种设置一种那种啊包办一切"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 413100,
      "end_ms": 414140,
      "text": "把一切问题都解决"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 414140,
      "end_ms": 418590,
      "text": "把市场的资本主义的一切的弊弊端都消弭掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 418590,
      "end_ms": 420910,
      "text": "所谓的极右翼拥抱绝对专制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 420910,
      "end_ms": 421350,
      "text": "不是的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 421350,
      "end_ms": 422290,
      "text": "极右翼是这样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 422290,
      "end_ms": 424050,
      "text": "极右翼是要天经地义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 424050,
      "end_ms": 424920,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 424920,
      "end_ms": 429700,
      "text": "他不需要行政力量来实现某种介入性的专制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 429700,
      "end_ms": 430820,
      "text": "极右翼认为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 430820,
      "end_ms": 431340,
      "text": "就是说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 431340,
      "end_ms": 432820,
      "text": "所有人的思想观念"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 432820,
      "end_ms": 437050,
      "text": "应当就是恢复一种天经地义的等级制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 437050,
      "end_ms": 438590,
      "text": "这个天经地义的等级制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 438590,
      "end_ms": 440130,
      "text": "等级制是道德伦理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 440130,
      "end_ms": 441450,
      "text": "意识形态层面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 441450,
      "end_ms": 442910,
      "text": "是就是就是对的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 442910,
      "end_ms": 444220,
      "text": "就就懂吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 444220,
      "end_ms": 446540,
      "text": "然后你政府只是这个绝对正确的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 446540,
      "end_ms": 449270,
      "text": "这个等级制的执行者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 449870,
      "end_ms": 450630,
      "text": "刘该"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 452790,
      "end_ms": 454030,
      "text": "明白吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 455299,
      "end_ms": 457679,
      "text": "他可能是某某种教"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 457679,
      "end_ms": 459099,
      "text": "也可能某种圣人崇拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 459099,
      "end_ms": 460499,
      "text": "在这个圣人崇拜之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 460499,
      "end_ms": 461770,
      "text": "谁离圣人最近"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 461770,
      "end_ms": 463150,
      "text": "谁就是更牛逼的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 463150,
      "end_ms": 465690,
      "text": "或者谁谁是圣人给他打的旗号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 465690,
      "end_ms": 466570,
      "text": "他就是最牛逼的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 466570,
      "end_ms": 470070,
      "text": "所以极右翼等级制原教旨的这个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 471430,
      "end_ms": 473810,
      "text": "原教我们国家的原教旨主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 473810,
      "end_ms": 476770,
      "text": "你这它就是一种极右翼等级制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 478430,
      "end_ms": 479850,
      "text": "它是一种极右翼等级制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 479850,
      "end_ms": 483110,
      "text": "他在最底层的那个平民贫穷的贫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 483110,
      "end_ms": 485510,
      "text": "在最底层平民的那个思想观念"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 485510,
      "end_ms": 485710,
      "text": "都"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 485710,
      "end_ms": 489030,
      "text": "尤其是农村的保守的宗族秩序下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 489030,
      "end_ms": 490270,
      "text": "那些平民的思想观念里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 490270,
      "end_ms": 494940,
      "text": "这个就是就是谁离这个他偶像崇拜的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 494940,
      "end_ms": 496380,
      "text": "或神话的那个对象最近"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 497420,
      "end_ms": 501420,
      "text": "谁就就是分享他的那个教拳神拳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 501420,
      "end_ms": 504040,
      "text": "那个逐次衰减下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 504040,
      "end_ms": 506700,
      "text": "那那他作为一个民间的狂信者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 506700,
      "end_ms": 508660,
      "text": "他只要够纯正够纯洁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 508660,
      "end_ms": 511350,
      "text": "那他也可以分有这样一种神性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 511350,
      "end_ms": 515629,
      "text": "所以他只有乙understand嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 516789,
      "end_ms": 519089,
      "text": "他是你可以理解这是儒教变种嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 519089,
      "end_ms": 523900,
      "text": "他这是儒教变种没多大差别的儒教变种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 526940,
      "end_ms": 529310,
      "text": "他明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 529310,
      "end_ms": 531370,
      "text": "你比如说那个江西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 531370,
      "end_ms": 532890,
      "text": "江西的一些地方"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 532890,
      "end_ms": 536870,
      "text": "就是把这个相当这个神像的供奉呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 536870,
      "end_ms": 539870,
      "text": "你说这些东西是真的是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 539870,
      "end_ms": 541150,
      "text": "这已经是宗教了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 541150,
      "end_ms": 541710,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 541710,
      "end_ms": 542870,
      "text": "前线的宗教"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 542870,
      "end_ms": 543510,
      "text": "极右翼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 543510,
      "end_ms": 544250,
      "text": "前线的宗教"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 544250,
      "end_ms": 545190,
      "text": "他就觉得这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 545190,
      "end_ms": 546910,
      "text": "这不是政府介入不介入的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 546910,
      "end_ms": 551480,
      "text": "但是就是说他是直直接穿透到狂信徒的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 551480,
      "end_ms": 553970,
      "text": "他的所谓的平信图"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 553970,
      "end_ms": 556670,
      "text": "没有任何这个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 556670,
      "end_ms": 560750,
      "text": "没有任何教师集团的那个头衔和等级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 560750,
      "end_ms": 563270,
      "text": "身份的的平信徒"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 570960,
      "end_ms": 575200,
      "text": "嗯所以极右翼在等级制在天然等级之下啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 575200,
      "end_ms": 578600,
      "text": "极右翼的等级是天然等级制是宗教"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 578600,
      "end_ms": 579960,
      "text": "宗教神权性质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 579960,
      "end_ms": 582520,
      "text": "覆盖全全真全宇宙的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 582520,
      "end_ms": 582960,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 582960,
      "end_ms": 583840,
      "text": "全宇宙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 583840,
      "end_ms": 584640,
      "text": "全人类"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 584640,
      "end_ms": 585080,
      "text": "全宇宙"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 585080,
      "end_ms": 588790,
      "text": "全社会一切的一个一个神权等级制下面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 588790,
      "end_ms": 590740,
      "text": "他有自己的安稳的位置"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 590740,
      "end_ms": 592740,
      "text": "然后这里面的政府"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 592740,
      "end_ms": 596640,
      "text": "或者说具体的执行治理性的治理权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 596640,
      "end_ms": 598490,
      "text": "就是民政权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 598490,
      "end_ms": 602350,
      "text": "这些东西都是被反而是被看不起的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 602350,
      "end_ms": 602770,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 602770,
      "end_ms": 606870,
      "text": "反而是反而在这种极右翼当中是反而是被骂的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 606870,
      "end_ms": 609200,
      "text": "说你腐败不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 609520,
      "end_ms": 612120,
      "text": "不够圣圣洁啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 612120,
      "end_ms": 614760,
      "text": "所以反而你就说极右翼的那个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 614760,
      "end_ms": 616760,
      "text": "你说的是集权专制吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 616760,
      "end_ms": 620920,
      "text": "其实他这不不标准"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 620920,
      "end_ms": 624900,
      "text": "他这个答案这种描述是不对的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 624900,
      "end_ms": 627160,
      "text": "我们这只能我们只能说他是个总体主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 627160,
      "end_ms": 629420,
      "text": "然后这个里面的行政介入性权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 629420,
      "end_ms": 631420,
      "text": "反而是在这个总体主义当中是比较"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 631420,
      "end_ms": 639480,
      "text": "那个是是是会大家会默认他可能出错的"
